  "_comment": "SYNTHETIC. Illustrative ADR-BCP-017 ClientApplication instances; runtime authority is the Control Plane. Synthetic Affiliate Trading Ltd is a fictional, incorporated applicant from the fictional group in organisation/v1/examples/synthetic-group-organisation.json. It applies through the INTERNAL_GROUP channel and is approved INTERNAL only because the Control Plane evaluated its synthetic, verified PLATFORM_GROUP_AFFILIATE relationship; its ownership evidence and registration identifier (SYNTHETIC-0002) are fictional. Nothing here is a real organisation, a real registration or ownership fact, or a Nabhold decision. The v1 SUBMITTED application schema requires a registration identifier, so a pre-incorporation business cannot be shown here: the real unincorporated ZuriBeans and Equator & Estate Co. belong on the v2 path (admission/v2 and organisation/v2/examples/zuribeans-organisation-first.json), and their INTERNAL affiliations stay PENDING_REVIEW. Founding-group membership grants no INTERNAL entitlement by itself. Kilima Fresh Produce is a fictional external applicant, approved COMMERCIAL; the fictional Duma Logistics draft shows that a DRAFT may be incomplete, and an application withdrawn before submission needs no completeness either.",
